      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm looking for some advice on pallet stacking for our new high-density racking setup in rotterdam. we're dealing with some pretty heavy industrial loads and i'm worried about stability when we stack them high. what's the best way to handle the center of gravity and should we be using any specific interlocking patterns to keep things from tipping?",
